@opusforlife2 you should also edit the `PlaylistFragment` class:
- in `handleResult()` store `result.getUrl()` in a class field (e.g. `cleanUrl`)
- in `onOptionsItemSelected()` share `cleanUrl` if it is not null, otherwise share the old `url`

You mean something like:
```java
public class PlaylistFragment extends BaseListInfoFragment<PlaylistInfo> {

    private String cleanUrl;
```
and
```java
    public void handleResult(@NonNull final PlaylistInfo result) {

        cleanUrl = result.getUrl();
```
and
```java
    case R.id.menu_item_openInBrowser:
        ShareUtils.openUrlInBrowser(requireContext(), (cleanUrl != null)? cleanUrl : url);
        break;
    case R.id.menu_item_share:
        ShareUtils.shareUrl(requireContext(), name, (cleanUrl != null)? cleanUrl : url);
        break;
```
